{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7816","id":5215330196,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNtuflA","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7816/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7816/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/2ec667791421bac63d65673e594213ef805f44fb","number":7816,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(fleet): repair two main build breaks (FLEET_REPOS size, atlas schema fileset)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Two independent breaks in the fleet package build on main, both found while building the amd toplevel (every NixOS build from current main fails):\n\n1. **fleet-queue E0308** — c512bc31df (#5595) changed `FLEET_REPOS: [&str; 9]` to `[&str; 10]` while only editing the comment above it; no entry was added (both `dezren39/nix` and `dezren39/darwin-nix` were already listed). Fix: size back to 9, matching the actual 9-entry allowlist.\n2. **atlas-core missing .sql** — since the search serve role landed (#5604), the fleet build compiles atlas-core, whose `stage.rs` `include_str!`s `../../../schema/atlas_stage_v1.sql` and `stage_registry_v1.sql`. The `fleetSrc` fileset in `pkgs/fleet/default.nix` did not include `../atlas-search/schema`, so the build died with \"No such file or directory\". Fix: add the schema dir to the fileset union.\n\nVerification (on amd, this branch): `nix build .#fleet` — exit 0, `/nix/store/cs0bif2700vjw4rbcn92aqfcmyvy4jpq-fleet-0.1.0`. Before the fixes it failed first at break 1, then at break 2.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796765622&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7816&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7816&signature=fd140f3db0845ef68b8a5dd0b254a16558c1a0c8b31d819913dfc5d576c4472e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7816?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Nee